{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0574_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ca9979afa2b08d06b89ee70045e49af91f8b67dd6608fc6a685aabdf3a98b6fd", "ja": "（可奈の『オリジナル声になって』のステージは、\n歌への想いが伝わってきて、温かい気持ちになった）", "zh": "（可奈演唱《变成原创的声音》的舞台，让人感受到了她对歌唱的热爱，心里也变得暖暖的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0574_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a17f915f3f381b51109c9179a93d17e6ab2a3666ee2f82547a0f784d5bfbc239", "ja": "可奈、お疲れさま。\nすごく良いステージだったよ！", "zh": "可奈，辛苦了。\n刚才的舞台非常棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0574_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "3f5f79bb2a035213ee9a02c682a3b58c58ca439d8c6c027767181de173b558c1", "ja": "{$P$}さん……！\nありがとうございますっ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生……！\n谢谢您♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0574_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "eb1fa3e28f35e6f7998f26ce06854b12e17cd60efd2005a77a3e6b258b96ac3a", "ja": "大好きな歌を思いっきり歌えましたし、\n会場の人たちも、いっぱい声を返してくれました！", "zh": "能尽情唱着自己最喜欢的歌，\n现场的大家也给了我好多好多的呼应！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0574_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "4ed4439e28df8d70ab579237ea576d7b49ac7605876ebbbdd9a76c5d49671cb6", "ja": "本当に、楽しすぎるステージでした！\n終わったばかりだけど……またやりたいです！", "zh": "真的是一场开心到不得了的演出！\n虽然才刚结束……但我还想再来一次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0574_1005_p", "source_sha256": "85e0b09cd5fad8cc74c4af6a50b41f86cd1690ee56a0d70ab49ec3817dc22bbe", "ja": "ははっ、そうか。ちょっと気が早いけど……\n次のライブも、同じぐらい楽しんでいこう！", "zh": "哈哈，是吗？虽然现在说这个还早了点……\n下次演出也一起享受同样的快乐吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0574_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "95ab5814ab03b939009c78daa6eb85a941fa4b21e0602560558420555868fb2c", "ja": "はいっ♪\n次も、みんなの前で……えへへ♪", "zh": "好的♪\n下次也要在大家面前……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0574_1007_p", "source_sha256": "61727f9281699d469469a16f9b80cf80a1a6d81c103df708f164d5af21eb41b0", "ja": "可奈？", "zh": "可奈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0574_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "798fb1a8ee8ea85327f30792e5b7330f2f679301cb1afdbeb9330ce6a6304ad0", "ja": "あっ！　えっと、次があると思ったら嬉しくて……。\nその……さっき、昔のことを思い出しちゃったから。", "zh": "啊！那个，一想到还有下次就太高兴了……\n那个……因为我刚才，想起了以前的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0574_1009_p", "source_sha256": "104909598c0434bd768da235a53b6dc99aabd45f4b6ed48d65a16ee964536e96", "ja": "昔のこと？", "zh": "以前的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0574_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "f32f16e78be43336d502c727c66cbfb5e8be2c79310ec40ccf49625917f65460", "ja": "はい。アイドルになる、ずっと前ですけど……\nおうちのリビングが、私のステージだったんです。", "zh": "是的。那还是在成为偶像之前很久的事……\n家里的客厅，就是我的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0574_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "07b760f1793bda9c3a89012d50647091d4184f31d218f7d2034ff20ff61f6bc1", "ja": "お客さんは、ぬいぐるみ達や、お父さんとお母さんで。\nでも、今日はあんなにたくさんの人の前で……。", "zh": "观众是那些毛绒玩偶，还有爸爸和妈妈。\n可是，今天却是在那么多人的面前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0574_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "775a1bd2ce8728df9bfe3779a15f227c2b98b73d9932cbf0df964ae731bc0cb4", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\n私、歌を諦めなくて……本当によかったです♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n我没有放弃唱歌……真的太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0574_1014_p", "source_sha256": "04727c9d392753072b1f50286e12b05eeb96001d16505f0f194040be58527699", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。", "zh": "嗯，就是说啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0574_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "89f4829bad8966fa744c7ebadc0245f585a7923187e24e78f2cbd90e2d9ae3da", "ja": "私、もっともっと歌が上手になりたい……！\n私の気持ちを、たくさん歌声に乗せたいです！", "zh": "我想变得更更更擅长唱歌……！\n想把我满满的心意，都寄托在歌声里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0574_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "96b2c5c43140062aa6c47b0c8bcb3e395e45b91b98b0e291c4b2c797a6635850", "ja": "そして世界中の人に、届けられたら……なんて、\n思っちゃって。……や、やっぱり気が早いですよね！", "zh": "要是能把歌声传达给全世界的人……什么的，我不小心就这么想了。……不、不对，果然还是想得太早了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0574_1017_p", "source_sha256": "182ad0e3e1f9fecce38007ada2eed0358c6e0ad7f15e126227b1c800a0536379", "ja": "いや、そんなことないよ。\n可奈ならできるって、俺は信じてる。", "zh": "不，才没这回事呢。\n我相信只要是可奈就一定能做到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0574_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "66424d59e6f9b7e00d0c058c2ee26f582a3de675d8593094f2ec27a2169ff7e6", "ja": "……！　{$P$}さん……。\nすぅ～……。", "zh": "……！　{$P$}先生……。\n呼～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0574_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "60c283c7b1f658f0373da98e2f4f3c449fd2c7c9ca32a9cc797cfddc545bad3f", "ja": "可奈は歌が大好き～♪　これまでもこれからも～♪\nず～っとず～っと、歌い続けま～す♪", "zh": "可奈最喜欢唱歌啦～♪　无论过去还是未来～♪\n都～会一直一直，唱下去～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0574_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "2a11c4d3f633fa621af637d9cfb24d32cd4de174cfd122d42f4eab387ca63609", "ja": "だからこれからも、\n私の歌を一番近くで聞いててくださいね♪", "zh": "所以今后也请一直在最近的地方，聆听我的歌哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
